# Apps that ⌘Q asks to quit with their own command instead of closing their windows (hypr/scripts/quit-app).
# For apps that a closed window leaves running in the tray and whose process ⌘Q can't safely stop itself.
# Format: window class regex = command (run with bash), or window class regex @ window title regex = command for apps
# that share a class (Quickshell's windows). Personal additions go to quit-commands.local (not in the repo); a plugin's
# go in its own quit-commands file (plugins/README.md).
